    summary_60s: 'A clock is a tool we use to measure time. It tells us the current hour, minute, and second. There are three main parts of a clock: Hour Hand : This is the shorter hand that shows the hour. Minute Hand : This is the longer hand that shows the minutes. Second Hand : This is the thi',
