    topic: 'CALCULUS',
    subtopic: 'Exponential Functions',
    summary_60s: 'Graphs of exponential functions, limits and derivatives of exponential functions, and properties of the exponential function e and its derivatives.',
    key_formulas: '• Power Rule: d/dx(xⁿ) = n·xⁿ⁻¹\n• Product Rule: d/dx(uv) = u(dv/dx) + v(du/dx)\n• Quotient Rule: d/dx(u/v) = [v(du/dx) - u(dv/dx)] / v²\n• Chain Rule: dy/dx = (dy/du) · (du/dx)\n• Indefinite Integral: ∫ xⁿ dx = [xⁿ⁺¹ / (n + 1)] + C (n ≠ -1)',
