    id: 1143,
    subject: 'Mathematics',
    exam_type: 'JAMB • WAEC • NECO Standard',
    class_level: 'SS1-SS3 (Senior Secondary)',
    topic: 'CALCULUS',
    subtopic: 'Second-Order Differential Equations',
    summary_60s: 'Homogeneous second-order differential equations with constant coefficients and geometric applications including exponential growth and decay problems.',
    key_formulas: '• Power Rule: d/dx(xⁿ) = n·xⁿ⁻¹\n• Product Rule: d/dx(uv) = u(dv/dx) + v(du/dx)\n• Quotient Rule: d/dx(u/v) = [v(du/dx) - u(dv/dx)] / v²\n• Chain Rule: dy/dx = (dy/du) · (du/dx)\n• Indefinite Integral: ∫ xⁿ dx = [xⁿ⁺¹ / (n + 1)] + C (n ≠ -1)',
