    topic: 'VARIATION',
    subtopic: 'Types Of Variation',
    summary_60s: 'Variation in mathematics refers to how one quantity changes in response to changes in another. The two main types of variation are Direct Variation and Inverse Variation. The types of variation are: Direct. Inverse. Joint. Partial. Direct Variation In direct variation, two variab',
