    topic: 'STATISTICS',
    subtopic: 'Central Tendency',
    summary_60s: 'Statistics is a branch of mathematics that involves the collection, analysis, interpretation, and presentation of data. Measures of location (or central tendency)describe a dataset by identifying its center. The three main types are: Mean – Average of all values Median – Middle v',
